41533::$$$message_0309_0000_0000$$$::"Here's the character artist's comment. [br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01e(中)] 'Rin's maid outfit (left) follows a faux orthodox concept. Saber's (right) is in the maid cafe style, I guess?'"::
41534::$$$message_0309_0001_0000$$$::"Hahaha, you little punk. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服02a(中)]Well, it's cute, so I'll allow it."::
41535::$$$message_0309_0002_0000$$$::"There's more.[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01f(中)]'This maid outfit wouldn't have flown in the past, but it's pretty okay now.'"::
41536::$$$message_0309_0003_0000$$$::"Lies!"::
41537::$$$message_0309_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah, he's lying.":ܖ@